{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22795","headline":"臼口阻风十日 · 白居易","name":"臼口阻风十日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洪涛白浪塞江津，处处邅回事事迍。\n世上方爲失途客，江头又作阻风人。\n鱼鰕遇雨腥盈鼻，蚊蚋和烟痒满身。\n老大光阴能几日，等闲臼口坐经旬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}